    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scenario 3 - Hot Lead Accountability Loop (WAHA)\n\nEvery 15 min, 09:00-20:00 IST. Reads Sheet1 rows with Call_Status = Pending. If Alert_Sent_At is older than 25 min and Reminder_Sent = No -> owner reminder; older than 45 min and Escalation_Sent = No -> final escalation. Both to XXXXXXXXXX via WAHA. Marks Reminder_Sent / Escalation_Sent = Yes.",
